+ *
+ * exynos-woa D2/D3 (notes/gpu-umd-d3d11.md), #included at the end of D3D11.cpp (one translation unit: the fills
+ * reuse its static wrappers and stubs): the D3D11_1, WDDM1_3 and WDDM2_0 DDI tables, still at 3D pipeline
