+ * type changed again are here (D111_ = D3D11.1 type, D113_ = WDDM 1.3, D120_ = WDDM 2.0), as are the new entries
+ * that need a real body (D11x_) and the DXGI 1.2-1.4 base functions those interfaces come with.
